---
<section class="hero-section">
  <div class="container hero-container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>Minik Anlar — Hamilelik Takibi ve Anı Defteri</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Hafta hafta gebelik yolculuğunu takip et, en özel anlarını tek yerde sakla.</p>
      
      <div class="cta-group">
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-appstore">Yakında App Store'da</a>
        <!-- <a href="#" class="btn btn-android">Yakında Play Store'da</a> -->
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="hero-visual">
      <div class="mockup-placeholder">
        <span>Uygulama Ekranı (Bugün)</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    padding: 80px 0 60px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--pageBackground), #ffffff);
  }
  
  .hero-container {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 40px;
  }
  
  .hero-content {
    flex: 1;
  }
  
  .hero-content h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  
  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  
  .cta-group {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  
  .btn-appstore {
    background-color: var(--ink);
  }
  
  .btn-appstore:hover {
    background-color: #000;
  }
  
  .hero-visual {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  
  .mockup-placeholder {
    width: 300px;
    height: 600px;
    background-color: var(--card-bg);
    border: 8px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 40px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-container {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .cta-group {
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
